00:47:50.376 --> 00:47:50.776
NOW,

00:47:51.117 --> 00:47:53.419
This is called congenital Zika syndrome.

00:47:56.741 --> 00:48:01.665
Brazil has launched a large-scale program to monitor babies born to mothers with Zika.

00:48:04.267 --> 00:48:08.131
No one can say how many children will develop neurological complications.

00:48:09.652 --> 00:48:10.953
This will take a long time.

00:48:11.341 --> 00:48:13.582
Before the experts have any certainties.

00:48:16.803 --> 00:48:20.924
These children are growing up and nobody knows how they will develop.

00:48:22.684 --> 00:48:23.625
There are also the mothers.

